    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061210.0309\n\nDOHA, Dec 10 , 2006, 2006\n\nThailand beat Malaysia to win men's sepaktakraw regu gold\n\n\n\n\nThailand overcame Malaysia 21-19, 22-20 to win the Asian Games men's sepaktakraw regu gold medal here Sunday.\n\nMyanmar and Indonesia shared bronze.",
